  "sourceText": "Passionfruit Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 11:05pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 cups passionfruit pulp\n cup orange juice\n3 tablespoons orange-flavoured liqueur\n1 tablespoon icing sugar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 1. Combine all ingredients until well mixed. The sauce must be refrigerated and will keep for about 1 week.",
